   {
    "id": "p_00026",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The following new requirements on POSIX implementations derive from alignment with the Single UNIX Specification:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00027",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     5,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The requirement to include [A38][I39]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I39][/A38] has been removed. Although\n[A40][I41]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I41][/A40] was required for conforming implementations of previous POSIX\nspecifications, it was not required for UNIX applications.",
    "placeholders": {
